WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:07.460
Welcome to Kaiapoi riverbank, behind me we
have the rebuild of the riverbank.

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:11.170
You can see the new Coastguard building - Maritime
Rescue.

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:15.420
The old wharf where the Tuhoe used to sit
has gone, been demolished and replaced with

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:16.560
a rock wall.

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:22.610
As you can see progress is good, it's on schedule
and we're almost in the finished and start

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:23.520
planting stage.

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:29.500
Behind me here, we have our new exciting development
of the south side of the river,

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:31.120
on the main block side.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:37.920
We have a walkway, we have picnic seating
areas and we have a fishing area with facilities

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:42.960
for cleaning fish for those of you lucky enough
to catch fish in our glorious river.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.440
Development here is in two parts.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:51.080
On the land side, Jed's exciting new building
comes over towards us from here.

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:56.069
The stop-bank gets modified as part of that
and the slope you are looking at now has steps

00:00:56.069 --> 00:01:01.360
built all the way down for sitting in the
sun, looking out over the river.

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:07.340
In the river itself, we are putting 90 metres
of pontoon, which is going to happen this year.

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:11.540
You'll be able to literally drive up in your
fizz-boat, park there, come ashore and have

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:13.580
a latte, just like the Riviera.

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:19.740
Contractors, as you can see, are still there,
but they have finished the major work.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:24.590
We're up to the finishing touches, the landscaping
and the planting and by next spring it will

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:27.040
all be looking pretty damn good.

